# 4. Release Strategy

Aura shall move through the following release stages:

```text
Documentation Complete
↓
Engineering Foundation
↓
Internal Prototype
↓
Hardware Alpha
↓
Feature Alpha
↓
Private Beta
↓
Release Candidate
↓
Version 1.0
```

Each stage has explicit exit criteria.

Dates may be assigned later, but quality gates must not be removed to satisfy arbitrary dates.

